==== ''Your Friendly Neighborhood Spider-Man'' seasons 3 and 4 ====
A third season of ''[[Your Friendly Neighborhood Spider-Man]]'' is in development, with Jeff Trammell returning as head writer and showrunner,<ref name="YFNSMS3" /><ref name="TrammellShowrunner" /> while Trammell confirmed work had begun on a fourth season in October 2026.<ref name="YFNSMS4" /> Winderbaum said in October 2025 that future seasons would be released annually "for a number of years",<ref name="WinderbaumEWOct2025" /> with season two releasing in January 2027.<ref name="YFNSMS2Premiere" />

==== ''Marvel Zombies: The Fist of Khonshu'' and ''The Last Guardian'' ====
In January 2026, active development on a continuation of ''[[Marvel Zombies (TV series)|Marvel Zombies]]'' had begun with director [[Bryan Andrews (filmmaker)|Bryan Andrews]],<ref name="WinderbaumZombiesContinuation" /> and had entered production by April 2026.<ref name="WinderbaumZombiesS2" /> That October, the two-episode specials, ''The Fist of Khonshu'', and ''The Last Guardian'', were announced,<ref name="NYCC2026Marvel" /><ref name="NYCC2026THR" /> with Jennifer Muro producing and serving as [[head writer]] on the specials.<ref name="Muro" /> ''The Fist of Khonshu'' and ''The Last Guardian'' will be released in October 2028 and October 2029, respectively. They follow the special ''The Winter Soldier'' that will be released in October 2027.<ref name="NYCC2026Marvel" />

==== ''Zodiac'' ====
Two spies chase targets with special abilities.<ref name="CohenLeshemZodiac" />

In September 2026, Marvel Television was reported to have greenlit a [[spy thriller]] series that was being referred to as ''Zodiac'',<ref name="DDBAS3FinalZodiac" /> which was formally announced the following month.<ref name="NYCC2026THR" /> Shortly after, Amit Cohen and [[Ron Leshem]] were revealed as the series' writers.<ref name="CohenLeshemZodiac" /> Filming is expected to begin in early 2027 in London.<ref name="ZodiacFilming" /> ''Zodiac'' will be released in 2028.<ref name="NYCC2026THR" />

